Mole
----
Grub ships Mole (https://github.com/tw93/Mole), a separate program by tw93,
licensed under GPL-3.0-or-later, inside Grub.app at Contents/Resources/mole.
The version is pinned in mole.lock.json. Grub changes two of its files so the
bundled copy never updates or removes itself; the changes are listed in
scripts/fetch-mole.js and in CHANGES-BY-GRUB.txt next to the bundled copy.
The source of the exact Mole in each release is attached to that release on
GitHub. "Mole" and its logo are Mole's trademarks. Grub is not affiliated
with or endorsed by Mole.
